---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber off
    actor Admin
    actor Steward
    participant AdminSite as Site page (admin view)<br/>/detail/[namesite]<br/>SiteSteward.tsx
    participant Pages as Site page and<br/>profile page
    participant Server as Server actions<br/>utils/steward-actions.ts
    participant DB as Supabase DB

    Note over Admin,DB: Covers US 3.0.2. All steps are on main as of October 11, 2026 (#133, #139, #238, #240).

    Admin->>AdminSite: Open site and select 'Assign steward' or 'Change'<br/>(shown when app_metadata.role = admin)
    Admin->>AdminSite: Type part of a name
    AdminSite->>Server: searchStewards(query)
    Server->>Server: getAdminUserId(): auth.getUser(),<br/>app_metadata.role = 'admin' and app_metadata.authenticated = true
    alt Caller is not Admin
        Server-->>AdminSite: Return [] (UI shows 'No people match that name.')
    else Caller is Admin
        Server->>DB: people where display_name ilike %query%, limit 10
        DB-->>Server: Matching people
        Server-->>AdminSite: Steward list
        AdminSite-->>Admin: Show matches (AT 1)
    end

    Admin->>AdminSite: Select one person
    AdminSite->>Server: assignSiteSteward(siteId, personId)
    Server->>Server: getAdminUserId(): auth.getUser(),<br/>app_metadata.role = 'admin' and app_metadata.authenticated = true
    alt Caller is not Admin (AT 4)
        Server-->>AdminSite: {success:false, error:'Only admins can assign a steward.'}
        AdminSite-->>Admin: Show error
    else Site id or person id not valid
        Server-->>AdminSite: {success:false, error:'Invalid site or person.'}
        AdminSite-->>Admin: Show error
    else Caller is Admin
        Server->>DB: UPSERT site_stewards {site_id, steward_id, assigned_by, assigned_at}<br/>ON CONFLICT site_id (service role, replaces old steward)
        alt Database error
            DB-->>Server: Error (logged on the server)
            Server-->>AdminSite: {success:false, error:'The steward was not assigned. Try again.'}
            AdminSite-->>Admin: Show error
        else Saved
            DB-->>Server: Saved
            Server-->>AdminSite: {success:true}
            AdminSite-->>Admin: Show new steward (AT 2)
        end
    end

    Steward->>Pages: Open site page or steward profile
    Note right of Pages: middleware.ts redirects to /login when there is no user.<br/>An unapproved user gets only /sites (other pages redirect there)<br/>and 403 for a server action.
    Pages->>Server: getSiteSteward(siteId) on site page /<br/>getSitesForSteward(personId) on profile
    Server->>Server: Session client. No check in the action. RLS select policy<br/>on site_stewards and people allows approved users only<br/>(20261010000100_require_approval_for_people_reads.sql).
    Server->>DB: site_stewards join people(id, display_name) by site_id /<br/>join sites_pa(namesite, archived_at, is_active) by steward_id
    DB-->>Server: Steward or stewarded sites
    Server-->>Pages: Data with steward
    Pages-->>Steward: Show 'Steward: {name}' linked to /people/{id},<br/>and 'Steward of' on the profile (AT 3)

    Note over AdminSite,DB: The role check must not use user_metadata. A user can change it (see .agents/rules/security.md).<br/>Role store: auth app_metadata (server-writable only).
